   "id": 101973,
   "title": "Superset - the open source IDE for the AI Agents era",
   "body": "**_TL;DR_ [Superset](https://superset.sh/)** is a terminal-first IDE with built-in agents management, PR review, and remote workspaces; built for running coding agents in parallel.\n\nSuperset is a daily driver for great teams including YC companies, engineers at Wix, DoorDash, Netflix, and major OSS products/projects including [homebrew](https://github.com/Homebrew/brew), [mastra](https://github.com/mastra-ai/mastra), [browser-use](https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use) and many more\\\n\\\nCheck out our fun video interviewing some of our users \ud83d\udc47\n\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_d_eYBV8cI>\\\n\\\nWe're Avi, Kiet and Satya\\\n\\\nThe future workspace for software development looks less like a text editor based IDE and more like a tool to help devs manage multiple Claude Code or Codex sessions, setup automations and workflows for coding agents, aggregate context from tickets, logs, etc, and efficiently review changes.\\\n\\\nSince launching just 5 months ago:\n\n* **11K+ Github stars** and **75+ contributors,**\n* Used as the daily driver in great teams including YC companies, engineers at OpenAI, Google, Vercel, and major OSS products/projects including [homebrew](https://github.com/Homebrew/brew), [mastra](https://github.com/mastra-ai/mastra), [browser-use](https://github.com/browser-use/browser-use) and many more\n* A thriving community with **5K+ followers on X**, **1K+ members on Discord.**\n* Got **#1 on Product hunt** and **top 4 on HN twice**\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=101973&key=user_uploads/230159/5bfff019-f7dd-4262-b872-67641385eb17)\n\nX has been very supportive:\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=101973&key=user_uploads/230159/42ce6b2b-21fd-4d1b-9bcb-a00fecd85d52)\n\n\\\nCTO of Mastra:\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=101973&key=user_uploads/230159/3e7afc9f-1023-4d20-a701-324ecbc44273)\n\nVercel about Superset:\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=101973&key=user_uploads/230159/66749d1b-feea-4eb0-a2ba-3afb1a84e76a)\n\nPrinciple Engineer at Cloudflare\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=101973&key=user_uploads/230159/12c60756-7b29-45e8-96d4-72d9563979bb)\n\nCTO of Browser Use:\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=101973&key=user_uploads/230159/54080db5-f070-4d19-bf19-f9782075b1b0)\n\n\\\n**Superset Product Tour**\\\n<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YWDHn7gUwfg>\\\n**\\\nPlease try us and give us your feedback:**\n\nStar the repo: <https://github.com/superset-sh/superset>\\\nsend us your feedback: [hello@superset.sh](mailto:hello@superset.sh)\n\nTry superset: <https://superset.sh/>",
